Parts that follow other projects' code
--------------------------------------

Recurrent Complex (https://github.com/Ivorforce/RecurrentComplex), MIT License
    nthrc/mixin/rc/RejectBeforePreparationMixin and nthrc/rc/EarlyReject follow the order of the steps
    and checks of StructureGenerator.generateInternal, so a structure can be refused before it is prepared.

OptiRefine (https://github.com/Ecdcaeb/OptiRefine), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Hileb
    nthcompat/optirefine/AccPlaceholderFix applies the same name rule as OptiRefine's CursedMixinExtensions.

Re-implemented Minecraft logic
    nthrc/minecraft/OreVein, nthrc/minecraft/SectionNbt and nthcompat/oflights/OfLightsSnapshot repeat, in
    the same order, the math of a game or OptiFine method, so the result stays identical. That math
    remains subject to the terms of Minecraft and OptiFine; the MIT License above does not grant any
    right to it.

